==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*200 [[Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5.33~10 seconds<sup>160f~300f</sup>.
*200 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~8 seconds<sup>100f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey King]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

